de_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODE1Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83815281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches","html_url":"https://github.com/binky-stitches","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T16:08:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T16:08:10Z","body":"> [@aalleexxww](https://github.com/aalleexxww) btw I think what you called \"shadow acne\" is actually `shadow_filter = SHADOW_FILTER_NONE` still applying filter in Forward+ and Mobile renderers while it should not.\n\nAh OK thank you! 😄  I'll change the name of the topic to include that instead of shadow acne!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580675655/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582283076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101312#issuecomment-2582283076","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101312","id":2582283076,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z6oNE","user":{"login":"binky-stitches","id":83815281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODE1Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83815281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches","html_url":"https://github.com/binky-stitches","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binky-stitches/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T10:14:06Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T10:14:33Z","body":"Got some new shots comparing `shadow_filter = SHADOW_FILTER_OFF` to `shadow_filter = SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5`\n\nI'm unsure whether there should be a gradient showing at all on either shadow filter because the lights overlap each other, but it's a good comparison nonetheless.\n\n`SHADOW_FILTER_OFF` (off)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75a0039c-d720-4a03-bc94-83b1fa2d171a)\n\n`SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5` (on)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/310be877-c4cb-4304-9112-c4b725a457c2)\n\nThese are from the MRP so can be reproduced easily","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582283076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124569768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101312#issuecomment-3124569768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101312","id":3124569768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66PSao","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T17:58:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-27T17:58:51Z","body":"I replicated this on v4.5beta3 as well as v4.3 and v4.4. It is cause by the final step in shadow sampling having a [mixing step](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8b2739ee55f8bebe7c4a20c55841851c4f411efe/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas.glsl#L297) for the forward renderer. This causes the anti aliasing effect which is not present in the compatibility renderer.\n\nI tested and this was also present before we rewrote `textureProjLod()` in #106399. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124569768/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130088501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101312#issuecomment-3130088501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101312","id":3130088501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66kVw1","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T23:03:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T23:03:54Z","body":"> I replicated this on v4.5beta3 as well as v4.3 and v4.4. It is cause by the final step in shadow sampling having a [mixing step](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8b2739ee55f8bebe7c4a20c55841851c4f411efe/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/canvas.glsl#L297) for the forward renderer. This causes the anti aliasing effect which is not present in the compatibility renderer.\n> \n> I tested and this was also present before we rewrote `textureProjLod()` in [#106399](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106399).\n\nThat's just standard bilinear sampling. The awkward thing is that we are doing a single tap sample and calling it \"nearest\" despite the fact that it was never a \"nearest\" filter its just a single tap sample with bilinear. \n\nIn Godot 3.x we always use a nearest filter for canvas light shadows. So there, the single tap mode truly is a simple nearest filter. \n\nWe could probably just skip the bilinear interpolation when using the nearest mode","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130088501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148516527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101312#issuecomment-3148516527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101312","id":3148516527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67qoyv","user":{"login":"Rudolph-B","id":52322745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzIyNzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52322745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B","html_url":"https://github.com/Rudolph-B","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rudolph-B/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-03T16:05:10Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T16:24:17Z","body":"> We could probably just skip the bilinear interpolation when using the nearest mode\n\nSomething along the lines of?\n```glsl\nvec2 unit_p = floor(shadow_uv.xy / canvas_data.shadow_pixel_size) * canvas_data.shadow_pixel_size;\nfloat depth_sample = textureLod(sampler2D(shadow_atlas_texture, shadow_sampler), unit_p.xy, 0).r;\nshadow = step(depth_sample, shadow_uv.z);\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148516527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]